        "Myalgias/joint stiffness.",
        "Subjective fevers, night sweats, chills.",
        "Self-limited diarrhoea (seen in many viral illnesses).",
        "No focal chest pain; largely systemic/upper airway picture."
      ],
      "opposing_evidence": [
